  "sourceTitle": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next FP8 running at 524K context on 2x RTX PRO 6000 with vLLM — found an MTP long-context issue",
  "sourceBodyHash": "6caa9d9e399667c64c93c93c9c35c916227bdd0941e48da22cd7c57b1c91f5ea",
