  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T16:51:33.826343Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-20T00:38:47.173373Z",
  "totalBlocks": 13,
  "translatedBlocks": 11,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4abcc81aba8488e8",
      "translationZh": "已用 vLLM 在 2x RTX PRO 6000 上跑起 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next FP8，上下文长度为 524K。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6087c4b1fa6bb49",
      "translationZh": "当前配置为 TP2 + EP2、MTP3、PLE CPU 卸载，关闭前缀缓存，开启分块预填充，并使用 YaRN 2x。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90f90761baf83500",
      "translationZh": "在将上下文扩展到超过原生 262K 长度时，我遇到了一个有意思的问题。目标模型已正确扩展到 524K，但 Qwen3.8 MTP 草稿模型仍按 262K 创建。这导致在禁用前缀缓存时，Mamba/缓存几何结构校验失败。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b904ab9892efa1ee",
      "translationZh": "最后，我给 Qwen3.8 MTP 配置打了补丁，让草稿模型在 vLLM 构建其缓存配置之前继承目标模型的 max_model_len。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d4adf1e4b4a6911",
      "translationZh": "现在它能正常启动，输出如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9364a843b66587c",
      "translationZh": "GPU KV 缓存大小：654,980 个 token 每个请求 524,288 个 token 时的最大并发度：1.25x",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31241fc2ab314659",
      "translationZh": "EP 在每个 GPU 配置 256/512 个专家时也能正常工作，而且 vLLM 自动选择了 DeepGEMM FP8 MoE 后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d2f83c558b04308",
      "translationZh": "我还在测试一件事：MTP3 会回退到在草稿步骤之间重建 QSA 注意力元数据，因此我想对 MTP1、MTP2 和 MTP3 进行基准测试，看看哪个在实际使用中能达到最高的 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cd42f2a58479df7",
      "translationZh": "想知道是否还有其他在 SM120/vLLM 上运行 Flash-Next 的人遇到过同样的长上下文 MTP 草稿问题，或者有更简洁的上游修复方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a26836f203823c2b",
      "translationZh": "模型到目前为止运行稳定，总吞吐量约为 135tk/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "564db8b8035deff9",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/SpendLucky1273 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
